      274.72
    ],
    "text": "2. By virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 5 of the Special Commodity Levy Act No. 48 of 2007, as listed out in the Schedule above, I, do hereby order to waive - off;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
